 "content_notes": "Part 2 of Case File 37. Everyone real appears only as a faceless rim-lit silhouette tagged NOT A LIKENESS: a syndicate member (convicted in 2026; the pilot, convicted in PNG, is mentioned but not shown or named, as in Part 1). No one is named anywhere: their names were not in the official releases' extracts and add nothing. The AFP's 'alleged links to Italian organised crime' is not used. Police, the analyst, the lab scientist and the young man on the lesson card are generic figures; no badge, crest, flag, logo, vehicle livery, aircraft registration or real business name is drawn. No drugs are shown: the bags are plain wrapped sacks. No weapon, no violence; the arrest shows a man led to a car, hands behind his back. The two-year surveillance is attributed ('Reportedly'). The statistic card names its source and period. Every card is our own typed graphic. No dialogue is invented. Legal status verified 2026-10-16 (sentenced 16 July 2026; no appeal found in searches).",
